# Configuration

Configuration is loaded from `config/base.env` with optional overrides in `config/.env`.

## Model Configuration

```bash
# Fast model for quick tasks (topic suggestion, JSON conversion)
LLM_MODEL_FAST=qwen3:8b

# Article model for generation (summarization, content integration)
LLM_MODEL_ARTICLE=deepseek-r1:14b

# Enable thinking mode for supported models
LLM_THINK_MODE=true
```

## Run Profiles

```bash
RUN_PROFILE=test   # Fast iteration: 1 topic, fewer sources
RUN_PROFILE=prod   # Full fidelity: 10 topics, more sources
```

## Key Settings

| Variable | Default | Description |
|----------|---------|-------------|
| `PHASE1_TARGET_SOURCES` | 20 | Sources to gather per topic |
| `MAX_TOPICS_PER_RUN` | 10 | Topics processed per run |
| `MAX_RESEARCH_ROUNDS` | 2 | Gap-filling iterations |
| `SOURCES_PER_SECTION` | 8 | Sources per article section |
| `LOOP_INTERVAL_SECONDS` | 60 | Delay between runs |

## Disable Phases

```bash
# Skip specific phases (comma-separated)
DISABLE_PHASES=phase7           # Skip citations
DISABLE_PHASES=phase5,phase7    # Skip discovery and citations
```

## Debug Mode

```bash
RESEARCH_DEBUG_SOURCES=true  # Save raw pages and LLM outputs
```
